title: "Pax5 single-cell and BCR repertoire analysis"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for single-cell RNA-seq and BCR (VDJ) repertoire
  profiling of wild-type versus Pax5-mutant mouse B cells, generating Figures
  4-6 of the accompanying manuscript.
